 in developing and allocating climate change-related responsibility and lia
 bility among private actors.\n The Cambridge Seminar Series on Law and the
  Climate Crisis explores the vital role of legal systems in tackling one o
 f the most pressing issues of our time.\n This series brings together top 
 experts in law and climate action to discus
END:VEVENT
